    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e3222f5ca6d0ace389f900</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e3222f5ca6d0ace389f900</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 15 Sep 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>会玩的人已经开始规划国庆假期了。</span></p><p><span>我们收集了6位朋友，关于国庆假期怎么过的诉求，讨论了6套方案给大家。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="103">01:43</a> 🙋朋友1-小美</span></p><p><span>“十一计划和男朋友出去玩，希望拍出7组不同风格的照片发朋友圈”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a>🙋 朋友2-小明</span></p><p><span>“9月连续打工没有休息日，十一希望躺平大回血”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2135">35:35</a> 🙋朋友3</span></p><p><span>“国内预算1.5w，国外预算3w”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2584">43:04</a> 🙋朋友4-大老板</span></p><p><span>“不买包，不买表，希望花光50w”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2917">48:37</a> 🙋朋友5-上进青年</span></p><p><span>“希望把握每分每秒充实自己，十一学习进步焕然一新”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3130">52:10</a> 🙋 朋友6-暴躁姐妹</span></p><p><span>“对老公忍无可忍，希望有个好旅伴儿”</span></p>]]></description>
